.Dd October 29, 2026
.Dt NETWORKSETUP 8
.Os Minkar
.Sh NAME
.Nm networksetup
.Nd configure the network settings
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Fl Ar command
.Op Ar argument ...
.Nm
.Fl printcommands | Fl help
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
reads and changes the network settings of System Preferences, kept by
.Xr configd 8
in
.Pa /Library/Preferences/SystemConfiguration/preferences.plist ,
through SystemConfiguration's network configuration API; changing them
needs root.
Network services are named as
.Fl listallnetworkservices
lists them; hardware ports and devices as
.Fl listallhardwareports
does.
.Fl printcommands
lists every command with its arguments.
.Ss Services
.Fl listallnetworkservices ,
.Fl listnetworkserviceorder ,
.Fl ordernetworkservices Ar service ... ,
.Fl createnetworkservice Ar name hardwareport ,
.Fl renamenetworkservice Ar service name ,
.Fl removenetworkservice Ar service ,
.Fl getnetworkserviceenabled Ar service ,
.Fl setnetworkserviceenabled Ar service Cm on | off ,
.Fl detectnewhardware .
.Ss Addresses
.Fl getinfo Ar service
shows the configuration method and what the service has now (address,
mask, router, IPv6, Ethernet address).
.Fl setmanual Ar service ip mask router ,
.Fl setdhcp Ar service Op Ar clientid ,
.Fl setbootp Ar service ,
.Fl setmanualwithdhcprouter Ar service ip ,
.Fl setv4off Ar service ;
.Fl setv6automatic ,
.Fl setv6LinkLocal ,
.Fl setv6off Ar service .
.Ss DNS
.Fl getdnsservers ,
.Fl setdnsservers Ar service server ... ,
.Fl getsearchdomains ,
.Fl setsearchdomains Ar service domain ... ;
.Cm Empty
clears the list.
.Ss Proxies
For each of
.Cm webproxy , securewebproxy , ftpproxy , socksfirewallproxy ,
.Cm streamingproxy
and
.Cm gopherproxy :
.Fl get Ns Ar proxy Ar service ,
.Fl set Ns Ar proxy Ar service server port ,
.Fl set Ns Ar proxy Ns Cm state Ar service Cm on | off .
Also
.Fl getproxybypassdomains ,
.Fl setproxybypassdomains Ar service domain ... ,
.Fl getautoproxyurl ,
.Fl setautoproxyurl Ar service url ,
.Fl setautoproxystate ,
.Fl getproxyautodiscovery ,
.Fl setproxyautodiscovery .
.Ss Hardware
.Fl listallhardwareports ,
.Fl getmacaddress Ar port ,
.Fl getMTU ,
.Fl setMTU Ar port value ,
.Fl listvalidMTUrange ,
.Fl getmedia ,
.Fl setmedia Ar port subtype Op Ar option ... ,
.Fl listvalidmedia .
.Ss Locations
.Fl listlocations ,
.Fl getcurrentlocation ,
.Fl createlocation Ar name Op Cm populate ,
.Fl deletelocation Ar name ,
.Fl switchtolocation Ar name .
.Ss Other
.Fl getcomputername ,
.Fl setcomputername Ar name .
There is no Wi-Fi yet: the AirPort commands report that the device is not
a Wi-Fi interface.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
0 on success, 1 when the parameters are not valid or the change fails.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr ipconfig 8 ,
.Xr scutil 8 ,
.Xr systemsetup 8
